  "description": "YIPQOH crystallizes in the trigonal crystal system with space group P -3. Reported CIF formula moiety: C78 H101 N3 Ni3 O31 Tb4,9(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Ni1 (Ni) has 6 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Ni2 (Ni) has 6 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Ni3 (Ni) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 15 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.403-4.442 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 100.67-144.85°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C78H119Tb4N3Ni3O40. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 3 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
